1
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:05,200
How far did your coffee travel?

2
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,600
It began as a cherry on a hillside, with two seeds inside.

3
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:17,050
Dried in the sun, then packed with four hundred thousand others.

4
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,700
Eighteen days at sea.

5
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:33,550
Somewhere in here is yours.

6
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,400
Eleven thousand kilometres, from one pair of hands to yours.
